  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Toast the sesame seed burger buns until lightly browned.",
    "In a pan, caramelize the onions until golden brown.",
    "In a separate pan, sear the tuna slices until cooked to desired doneness.",
    "Assemble the burgers by spreading melted french cheese on the toasted buns.",
    "Add a slice of seared tuna, a spoonful of caramelized onions, and a sprinkle of chopped arugula on top of the cheese.",
    "Drizzle with lemon juice and olive oil, and season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Serve immediately in a lacquerware bowl."
